{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5194351c60c2aff4415f30ba0dc0b08fd107049074fcd1073edd5e82c3e8c6ab", "ja": "（今日は育のPV撮影。\n撮影は予定通り進行していて、今は休憩中だ）", "zh": "（今天是育的PV拍摄。\n拍摄正按计划进行，现在正在休息）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "ece4e6b900838dfdc063fa0b42771e16ee1a1f9acddd6dde937a880a820cd356", "ja": "おつかれさま、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、どうだった？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我刚才表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ed3531c104116ce7a3003fc0212833bc387eee4adfc84a9b8b5a8fb413645731", "ja": "すごくよかったよ！　育が楽しそうだから、\n見ているこっちまで楽しくなったよ。", "zh": "特别棒哦！因为育看起来很开心，连在旁边看的我也跟着开心起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "0e2ff792524863fa7e655166654c6e1f4efe797a8d40ad921c805aa7369f8530", "ja": "えへへ♪　だってわたし、本当に楽しいんだもん！\nもちろん、お仕事中だってわかってるよ？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪因为我真的觉得很开心嘛！当然，我也知道现在是在工作哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "149955fa393f1b8963323a38232c668dcad8f1a3f416a34032c7094f5f7c417b", "ja": "わたし、もうお姉さんだもん！\nPV撮影だって、カンペキにできなくちゃ♪", "zh": "我已经是个大姐姐了嘛！\n就算是MV拍摄，也必须要完美完成才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e752abfd247fc416a43c86a051eb90eb144f0145d3a17f5f0c6f0fa94da4f06d", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n今日はまだ一度もNGを出してないし、すごいな！", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。\n今天到现在一次NG都没出过，真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "8b8fc93bb91f182642783665c34ef13de40d1a6103f27d40d2f22ffaf5b70ec2", "ja": "PVのお仕事って、撮影してるときは、\nどうなるのかちっともわからないんだけど……。", "zh": "拍摄PV的工作，在拍摄的时候，\n完全不知道最后会变成什么样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "0072bb14a9a43dd8ccc0c3229ee03f70f2ef8e2490f3ca20b4b0e322c4a0f85f", "ja": "完成したえいぞうを見ると、そうぞうしたより\nずっとステキになってるから、ビックリしちゃう！", "zh": "看到完成后的成片，比想象中\n还要精彩得多，所以总会吓一大跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "c82c9661dcb96c5b367f889305ec09fe07b89d05cae00881a7360699c7945b9e", "ja": "だから今回も、すっごく楽しみなんだ！", "zh": "所以这次也特别期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e9c227a9ec2009be128fd5435be593624ba4d09c04cd6f90c9458be5d69fab9c", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。育が頑張ってるから、\nきっとスタッフさん達も応えてくれると思うよ！", "zh": "啊，说得对。因为育一直在努力，\n工作人员们一定也会回应她的努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "050173aac53667c6b4080af4cecea6efd2f36bfaaaeb94d2061a155b4193078f", "ja": "うん！　今日のお仕事もしっかりがんばって、\nステキなPVにしてもらわなくちゃ♪", "zh": "嗯！今天的工作也要好好加油，争取拍出精彩的PV♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1e966d6e11e70cd8f782f6e72bfb29969b110a8caaf4155edde7f0f85052b51f", "ja": "おっと。そろそろ休憩が終わるな。\n次のカットの撮影は……いたっ！", "zh": "哎呀，休息时间差不多要结束了。\n下一镜的拍摄是……好痛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "97a9bb5fee80d58416cb807de2eade1deda77d730b4b26667019902eefede2bc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、大丈夫！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1013_p", "source_sha256": "967b679ec996387c2f0813a659610b9d5ee127f86a99df0f4f9234464e03001b", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だ。\n進行表の紙で、指を切っただけだよ。", "zh": "啊，没事。\n只是被流程表的纸划破手指了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "acf405a7b3ef1afeaa87a96f5f01adeef5ad6270d6fda3383f6cdd73b6cfb633", "ja": "ダメだよ、{$P$}さん！　わたしの\nカバンにばんそうこうが入ってるから、使って！", "zh": "不行啊，{$P$}先生！我的包里有创可贴，拿去用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8a5bd47ab685e0dd60dad3ba7444da5afb09ae57f7e8d283e9caafda3dcd16c9", "ja": "おお、ありがとう。\n育、用意がいいんだな？", "zh": "哦，谢谢。\n育，你准备得真周到啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "16c90b9f7a0d3073a2f5ef4c8bedcf28d89e8fc005f4efc974412ae0a161cdf7", "ja": "もしものときのためだよ！　わたしじゃなくても、\n誰かに何かあったら、助けてあげられるし……。", "zh": "是为了以防万一嘛！就算不是我，万一有人遇到什么事，也能帮上忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "31f4046bf57c76e452b54921d0a119371b9284eded50aa111951976dbdecd263", "ja": "だから{$P$}さんも、ちゃんと\n頼らなくちゃ。こまったときは、おたがいさまだよ？", "zh": "所以，{$P$}先生也要好好依靠别人。\n遇到困难时，互相帮助嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1018_p", "source_sha256": "55dde46d6e3d4ee677b79c15cfb6ee6bf2224d60254f4d2389887d908383754e", "ja": "わかったよ。それじゃ早速……\n絆創膏を1枚、もらってもいいかな？", "zh": "知道了。那我马上就……\n可以给我1张创可贴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "a920f1669b60f0f120ed34b02ca980fca650d607be5c00ff371bb487f5fa85a9", "ja": "うん、いいよ！\nどれでも、好きなのをえらんでね！", "zh": "嗯，可以呀！\n随便选一张你喜欢的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1020_p", "source_sha256": "93341db3eecb4b498c211ebf4ec278ccdd913b3be868258c8c0aa14d8c2616e7", "ja": "ありがとう、助かるよ。", "zh": "谢谢，帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0604_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "526a495f34b8fa656fe154b25c634b6ab0f1c6320a38a5bcd4128d8a90855378", "ja": "えへへ……これからもわたしに頼っていいよ、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……以后也可以继续依靠我哦，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
